+	// framebuffer with three functions that do nothing and reported
+	// `display|ready|1920x1080 framebuffer` for a display that cannot present a single frame.
+	// A patch meant to let a conformance probe run was manufacturing false passes inside it.
+	//
+	// 0x7FFFFFFF instead: non-zero, so it reads as a failure, and deliberately *without* the
+	// high bit that every real error code on this platform carries (0x8 followed by a facility
+	// number), so it can never be mistaken for one the platform returned. Nothing else in the lazy-binding path is touched: PLT0, the CallPlt header
